@Monitor.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5094

### Health check da própria API (inclui conexão com o PostgreSQL)
GET {{Monitor.API_HostAddress}}/health

### Dashboard — resumo geral
GET {{Monitor.API_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard
Accept: application/json

### Listar serviços (filtros opcionais: ?ativo=true&status=Online)
GET {{Monitor.API_HostAddress}}/api/servicos
Accept: application/json

### Cadastrar serviço
POST {{Monitor.API_HostAddress}}/api/servicos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Google",
  "endereco": "www.google.com",
  "porta": null,
  "endpoint": "/",
  "tipo": "Https",
  "intervaloSegundos": 30,
  "ativo": true
}

### Cadastrar serviço que vai ficar OFFLINE (porta fechada)
POST {{Monitor.API_HostAddress}}/api/servicos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "API Teste (offline)",
  "endereco": "localhost",
  "porta": 59999,
  "endpoint": "/health",
  "tipo": "Http",
  "intervaloSegundos": 30
}

### Buscar por ID
GET {{Monitor.API_HostAddress}}/api/servicos/1

### Atualizar
PUT {{Monitor.API_HostAddress}}/api/servicos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Google (editado)",
  "endereco": "www.google.com",
  "endpoint": "/",
  "tipo": "Https",
  "intervaloSegundos": 60,
  "ativo": true
}

### Pausar / retomar monitoramento
PATCH {{Monitor.API_HostAddress}}/api/servicos/1/ativo
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ativo": false }

### Status atual
GET {{Monitor.API_HostAddress}}/api/servicos/1/status

### Histórico de verificações
GET {{Monitor.API_HostAddress}}/api/servicos/1/verificacoes?limite=20

### Verificar agora (manual)
POST {{Monitor.API_HostAddress}}/api/servicos/1/verificar

### Métricas (30m, 1h, 24h, 7d...)
GET {{Monitor.API_HostAddress}}/api/servicos/1/metricas?periodo=24h

### Remover
DELETE {{Monitor.API_HostAddress}}/api/servicos/1
